				<Stat value="1,034" label="rides" />
			</Flex>
			<p class="ds-demo__note" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
				<code>Stat variant="numeral"</code>: the spec sheet's pair — the value big and
				large (<code>--font-display</code>, DM Sans Medium, at <code>--font-size-8</code>)
				with a caps label beside it on the numeral's top edge. The label wraps: a <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, or a title and its meta in the <code>label</code> slot.
			</p>
			<Flex gap={6} wrap="wrap" alignItems="start">
				<Stat variant="numeral" value="05" label="Posts" />
				<Stat variant="numeral" value="15"><Fragment slot="label">Min<br />read</Fragment></Stat>
				<Stat variant="numeral" value="04" label="Topics" />
