			<p class="ds-demo__note">
				<code>RuleLabel</code>: a caps label under a 1px dotted hairline — an optional
				leading <code>no</code> in the accent, the label, an optional trailing <code>meta</code> slot in the tertiary ink. <code>truncate</code> holds it to
				one line. <code>DimensionLabel</code>: the label centred on a dimension line —
				end ticks, a hairline, dots on an even pitch.
			</p>
			<div class="ds-demo__rule-labels">
				<RuleLabel no="05">Asserting on agent behavior</RuleLabel>
				<RuleLabel no="04">Tahoe mountain hair<Mono slot="meta">Latest</Mono></RuleLabel>
				<RuleLabel no="01" truncate>No honey, we have a dashboard at home</RuleLabel>
				<RuleLabel no="01">No honey, we have a dashboard at home</RuleLabel>
			</div>
			<Flex direction="column" gap={5} style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
				<DimensionLabel>Entries</DimensionLabel>
