				<DimensionLabel style="max-inline-size: 16rem;">In focus</DimensionLabel>
			</Flex>
		</section>

		<section class="ds-demo__section">
			<Heading as="h2" size={2} variant="secondary" class="ds-demo__h">Body — the reading role</Heading>
			<p class="ds-demo__note">
				Takes no size: the whole setting (face, size, line-height, letter-spacing,
				reading colour) comes from the <code>--font-body-*</code> tokens, so reading
				text is one decision rather than a step picked off the Text scale. Compare
				the size-4 line below — that step is the smallest HEADING, and prose set in
				it reads a size too large.
			</p>
			<div style="max-width: 62ch; display: grid; gap: var(--space-4);">
				<Body>
					I am a craftsman, I create things to be used. Even if they often are not,
					it is for the love of the process. My creativite nature comes through in
					an empathetic design, where with a deep understanding of another I can
					build them worlds.
				</Body>
				<Body variant="tertiary">
					Body, variant tertiary — the same setting in the quieter ink.
				</Body>
				<Text size={4} variant="secondary">
					Text size 4 for contrast — this is the sub-heading step, not body.
				</Text>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="ds-demo__section">
			<Heading as="h2" size={2} variant="secondary" class="ds-demo__h">Heading + H1–H4 · EM · Strong</Heading>
			<p class="ds-demo__note">
				Heading sizes 1–4 are the DS's (one Text step up each); 5 (44px) and 6 (72px)
				are the display steps, and with <code>responsive</code> a heading steps down
				one size below 1024 — <code>size={"{5}"} responsive</code> is a page title
				(44 / 32), <code>size={"{6}"} responsive</code> the post title (72 / 44).
				Resize to see the last two step.
			</p>
			<H1>H1 heading</H1>
			<H2>H2 heading</H2>
			<H3>H3 heading</H3>
			<H4>H4 heading</H4>
			<Heading as="p" size={2}>Heading as p, size 2</Heading>
			<Heading as="p" size={5} responsive>Size 5, responsive</Heading>
			<Heading as="p" size={6} responsive>Size 6</Heading>
			<Text size={4}>Body with <EM>emphasis</EM> and <Strong>strong</Strong>.</Text>
		</section>

		{/* BUTTONS -------------------------------------------------------- */}
