		{/* CARD ----------------------------------------------------------- */}
		<section class="ds-demo__section">
			<Heading as="h2" size={2} variant="secondary" class="ds-demo__h">Card — the flat card</Heading>
			<p class="ds-demo__note">
				A near-white panel on the page in the dashed edge (<code>--border</code>) at the
				box corner (<code>--radius-box</code>), the 1px tinted ring under it
				(<code>--shadow-panel</code>); no depth scale, no glass — one card. The header is <code>CardHeader</code>: <code>title</code> (a prop, or a slot for a title a script rewrites) in the caps
				mono voice on the header fill (<code>--panel-header-bg</code>), cut off by the same dashed edge, with the <code>meta</code> slot on the right — Card and Widget both render it, and so can a page by hand. <code>squeeze="title"</code> leaves the meta unclipped and ellipsises the title
				instead. <code>chrome={"{false}"}</code> is no frame, fill or clip at all.
			</p>
			<Grid templateColumns="repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr))" gap={4}>
				<Card title="infra #1">
					<CardBody><Text size={3}>Body content.</Text></CardBody>
				</Card>
