				the focus ring). SELECTED is read off the chip's own ARIA — <code>aria-current</code> on a link, <code>aria-pressed="true"</code> on a toggle
				— and fills it with the ink, so what a reader is told and what is drawn cannot
				fall out of step. The readout TAGS (see <a href="#readouts">Readouts</a>): <code>tone="accent"</code> draws the edge and caps in the accent, and <code>variant="arrow"</code> is a filled tag cut to a chevron — the ink, or the accent with <code>tone="accent"</code>.
