		<section class="ds-demo__section" id="knobs">
			<Heading as="h2" size={2} variant="secondary" class="ds-demo__h">Knobs · KnobGroup · Knob — the control panel</Heading>
			<p class="ds-demo__note">
				The playground's panel — the token editor on this page is one, /dotgrid's is
				another. A <code>Knob</code> is a label over a native control the page's
				script reads: a range with its live <code>output</code> (<code>out</code>), a
				colour picker, a checkbox, a text field; the default slot replaces the
				control for a row that holds its own. Groups are fieldsets under a caps
				legend; the <code>actions</code> slot takes DS Buttons. Where it sits is the
				page's decision.
			</p>
			<Knobs title="sample" aria-label="sample controls" style="max-inline-size: var(--space-14);">
				<Mono slot="meta" tone="accent">live</Mono>
				<Fragment slot="note">Nothing here is wired; it shows the rows.</Fragment>
				<KnobGroup legend="halftone">
					<Knob label="cell-size" type="range" out="demo-cell" min="2" max="24" step="1" value="6" />
					<Knob label="gamma" type="range" out="demo-gamma" min="0.2" max="3" step="0.05" value="0.8" />
				</KnobGroup>
				<KnobGroup legend="colour">
					<Knob label="accent" type="color">
